      "beat_id": "B05",
      "act": "THE PRODUCT",
      "new_visual_element": "The Kaplan-Meier product-limit estimate",
      "narration": "Kaplan-Meier handles this with one idea. Each time someone dies, look only at the people still being followed, and ask what share of them survived that moment. Multiply those shares together. A patient who left counts fully until the day they left, then simply stops counting.",
      "narration_text": "Kaplan-Meier handles this with one idea. Each time someone dies, look only at the people still being followed, and ask what share of them survived that moment. Multiply those shares together. A patient who left counts fully until the day they left, then simply stops counting.",
